xscreensaver-mystify for Debian-based systems
===============================================

This package installs the Mystify display hack for XScreenSaver.

Installed files:

  /usr/libexec/xscreensaver/mystify
  /usr/share/xscreensaver/config/mystify.xml
  /usr/share/applications/screensavers/mystify.desktop
  /usr/share/man/man6/mystify.6x.gz

On systems where Mystify does not appear automatically in the XScreenSaver
list, add it manually to the "programs" resource in ~/.xscreensaver.

For example:

  mystify -root

Do not edit ~/.xscreensaver while xscreensaver-settings is running, because
the settings program may rewrite the file.

This standalone package is intended for XScreenSaver releases that do not
already contain Mystify. Remove it before upgrading to an XScreenSaver package
that ships Mystify itself, because both packages would install the same files.
